 # 6.7.14.2
 
+## Hosting & Configuration
+
+### Configurable number of URLs per sitemap file
+
+The new option `shopware.sitemap.max_urls_per_file` sets how many URLs a generated sitemap file holds before the next file starts. The default stays at 49999.
+
 ## Critical Fixes
 
 ### Product and promotion duplication works again
