@@ -2893,6 +2893,10 @@ Move the definitions into a dedicated `Resources/config/custom-fields.xml` file
 
 <details>
 
+## Sitemap files will hold fewer URLs
+
+We will lower the default of `shopware.sitemap.max_urls_per_file` from 49999 to 25000 in 6.8. We decided to do this because several merchants reported that search engines time out while fetching very large sitemap files, and because the old hard-coded limit made it impossible to tune this on hosting setups with slow storage. After a long discussion we think a smaller default is the safer choice for most shops. If you rely on the file names or on the number of sitemap files, you will have to set the option back to 49999 in your `shopware.yaml`.
+
 ## Database: Time zone support required
 
 The database now requires time zone data to be loaded. You can verify whether time zone data is available by running:
